    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/falcosecurity/falcosidekick-ui/releases/tag/v2.2.0"/>
    <title>v2.2.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace CircleCI by Github Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add new dialog box to show the details of an alert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add an export feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow to specify the TTL for the keys with an unit (second, minute, day, week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow to set a password for Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow to disable the basic auth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add a button to clear the search input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix missing filter/search in query parameters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix search for hostnames and tags with dashes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix error with empty result from &lt;code&gt;count_by&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
